	)
	(text "V_MOTOR (A1 BAT+, via F1 15 A): motors 7.5 A max (F-SD-H-450 \nactuator  5.5 A + worm motor 2 A).\nF2 5 A feeds the CM4 board branch (V_BAT) only.\nF2/F1: Keystone 3557-2 holders; fit Littelfuse ATO\n0287005.PXCN (5 A) / 0287015.PXCN (15 A)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.95 111.76 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3a20a1a7-be7d-4a96-bd67-388f526064a1")
	)
	(text "12V Battery"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105.918 72.39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4bb4b2ec-4427-4282-b134-eeda165f170a")
	)
	(text "Standby drain: SW1 (power sheet) switches the CM4 / logic supply only.\nWith SW1 off the battery still feeds the RoboClaw logic (~30 mA, via F1)\nand U11 + dividers (~1.3 mA): about 31 mA, so 12 Ah lasts ~16 days.\nFor storage or transport unplug J1 (or remove F1/F2); charge first."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.95 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "65278272-93f3-427d-9ae1-870c6d49fa04")
	)
	(text "V_BAT (J1): 12.8 V nom, 10.0 V min, 14.6 V max (charging).\nSurvives 18 V max (TVS). Reverse battery: Q1 P-FET blocks it;\nsurvives -14.6 V, nothing conducts, no fuse blows."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 108.204 120.65 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "97e5dd86-419d-48b1-8295-b550fc1b307e")
	)
	(text "F1/F2 are the backup for a reversed battery: they blow only if Q1\nhas failed short (about 270 A then flows through D1/D3 and the RoboClaw\ndiodes). Check polarity and Q1 before replacing a blown fuse."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.95 134.366 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ce357a9d-0d7f-4038-9b4a-d2a7c530dac7")
	)
	(text "Powered by a 12.8V 12Ah LiFePO4 Lithium battery IP67 Waterproof"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 107.696 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d8d4a515-a6ea-43ed-ab55-59f414573884")
	)
	(text "Q1 - SP40P04NK, 40 V P-channel MOSFET. Rated 85 A continuous at\nTc 25 C (57 A at Tc 100 C), 340 A pulsed; Rds(on) 6.1 mOhm max at -10 V.\nCarries 8.7 A typ / 9.4 A worst: ~0.4 W typ, 0.55 W worst, ~0.8 W hot.\nGive Q1's drain tab a solid copper pour."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 108.204 125.222 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d9230a53-7c4f-4a1c-af5b-37bc37bd4be3")
	)
